{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help <strong>Iluminatus</strong> reach the top of each level and escape this strange world! Face off against mutant viruses, creepy llamas, unsettling aliens, and mighty bosses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready for a bizarre adventure where you don\u2019t control the character directly\u2014your only action is to <strong>jump to survive</strong>. Beat different levels, unlock the abilities you need, and advance further into the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This platformer features two distinct game modes:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story Mode</strong>: Climb massive pyramids, hopping from platform to platform to reach the summit. Every level is a new puzzle that will challenge your wits and skills.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless Mode</strong>: How far can you make it? Run nonstop through a path packed with enemies and obstacles. Time your jumps, avoid falling, and crush your high score.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to escape and uncover the mysteries of this bizarre world?</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Microentrepreneur","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4049270/458f9d6d89049d81ce3088d78ccb86ffbd339c0f.jpg"},{"name":"Pepe & to\u00f1o","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4049270/b5cbb8dc499e86e8e114396ae5d58b635bb8411f.jpg"},{"name":"Damn Capitalist Pig","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4049270/80146bb97e85317610fa1c93a1756cd7568e757f.jpg"},{"name":"Smells like linden","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4049270/3e518e71c1e6a6cc499d48cf05e3b850106fca50.jpg"},{"name":"Bllllllockhead","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4049270/e1fd664d36b4dc0384a5294173d841bbb9533ba0.jpg"},{"name":"The better","path":"http